// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`ARCA — con la facturación sola, la tarjeta es la de siempre > 🔴 el HTML de la pestaña General de un producto que sólo factura no cambia de rebote (snapshot) 1`] = `"<div><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-base"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>ARCA (facturación electrónica)</h2><span data-tono="curso" class="border-blue-700 text-blue-700 bg-blue-700/10 dark:border-blue-400 dark:text-blue-400 dark:bg-blue-400/15">Facturando en Homologación</span></div></div><div><div><div role="tablist" class="h-auto flex-wrap justify-start" aria-label="Secciones de ARCA"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true">General</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Homologación<span data-tono="ok" class="border-exito text-exito bg-exito/10">En uso</span></button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Producción<span data-tono="neutro" class="border-slate-600 text-slate-600 bg-slate-600/10 dark:border-slate-400 dark:text-slate-400 dark:bg-slate-400/15">Sin cargar</span></button></div><div role="tabpanel"><div class="grid gap-3"><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="grid gap-2"><label for="arca-cuit">CUIT</label><input id="arca-cuit" type="text" value="20111111119"></div><div class="grid gap-2"><label for="arca-punto-venta">Punto de venta</label><input id="arca-punto-venta" type="text" value="3"></div><div class="grid gap-2"><label for="arca-ambiente">Ambiente para facturar</label><select id="arca-ambiente"><option value="homologacion">Homologación (pruebas)</option><option value="produccion">Producción</option></select></div><div class="grid gap-2"><label for="arca-alias">Alias</label><input id="arca-alias" type="text" value=""></div></div><div class="col-span-full flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-save" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15.2 3a2 2 0 0 1 1.4.6l3.8 3.8a2 2 0 0 1 .6 1.4V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"></path><path d="M17 21v-7a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H8a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v7"></path><path d="M7 3v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h7"></path></svg>Guardar ARCA</button><button type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-send" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"></path><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"></path></svg>Probar conexión</button></div><details class="group mb-4 rounded-md border bg-muted/30 px-4 py-3 text-sm"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-[#1a3a5c]">ARCA / AFIP</span><span class="font-medium">¿Qué servicio debo habilitar para consultar datos de clientes por CUIT?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down ml-auto size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="mt-3 grid gap-3 border-t pt-3"><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">El botón <strong>"Consultar ARCA"</strong> en el formulario de clientes completa automáticamente nombre, domicilio y condición de IVA a partir del CUIT. Para que funcione, tu certificado debe tener acceso al webservice de Padrón Alcance 13.</p><div><p class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">1 — Ingresar al Administrador de Relaciones</p><ol class="ml-4 list-decimal space-y-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li>Ingresá con CUIT y Clave Fiscal a <a href="https://auth.afip.gob.ar" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-primary [overflow-wrap:anywhere] hover:underline">auth.afip.gob.ar<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></li><li>Buscá y abrí el servicio <strong>"Administrador de Relaciones de Clave Fiscal"</strong></li><li>Hacé clic en <strong>Nueva Relación</strong></li></ol></div><div><p class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">2 — Crear la relación para Padrón Alcance 13</p><ol class="ml-4 list-decimal space-y-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li>En <em>Servicio</em>, buscá y seleccioná: <strong>Consulta a Padrón Alcance 13</strong> (ws_sr_padron_a13)</li><li>En <em>Representante</em>, seleccioná el certificado que ya configuraste en Contalibra</li><li>Confirmá la relación</li></ol></div><p class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-md border px-3 py-2 text-xs border-exito/40 bg-exito/10 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg>Una vez habilitado, el botón <strong>"Consultar ARCA"</strong> en el alta de clientes funcionará automáticamente.</p><p class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-md border px-3 py-2 text-xs border-blue-300 bg-blue-50 text-blue-800 dark:border-blue-900 dark:bg-blue-950/40 dark:text-blue-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg>Este servicio es distinto al de facturación (WSFE). Necesitás habilitarlos por separado usando el mismo certificado.</p></div></details></div></div></div></div></div>"`;
